{"server":"cn","storyId":"act21side_level_act21side_05_beg","groupId":"act21side","stageId":"act21side_05","title":"恒久法则","storyCode":"IS-5","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"3d7482577c59f77da57da4e055665cdf2443a5c4f3c0da6d0b4030c06e5932c7","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"瓦拉赫愤怒于德克萨斯的选择，拉维妮娅提出要见贝纳尔多，准备质问他的选择。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我也考虑过莱昂图索在诓我的可能性，但是，一见到你我就知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是货真价实的德克萨斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"容我自我介绍一下，我是罗塞蒂家族的瓦拉赫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是哥伦比亚人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，罗塞蒂家族的大部分成员都是哥伦比亚人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如何，这里的监狱生活？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么特别的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真奇怪，照理说，你不应该在监狱里待这么久，贝洛内到底是怎么想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遵纪守法，很奇怪吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遵纪守法？但是叙拉古的法院，跟所谓的法律真的有关系吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如，在大部分的叙拉古城市，一个家族成员的成年礼，就是上一次法庭，进一次监狱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后，他的家族成员会像迎接一名战士一样，将他带回家族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个国家表面上的一切，对我们这种身处地下秩序的人来说，都形同虚设。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是在哥伦比亚长大的人，难道还需要我来解释吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“可笑”，我没有除此以外的评价。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，也拜此所赐，我们才能够如此顺利地在这里扎根。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很喜欢和人聊政治吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来你不喜欢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实我也不喜欢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就直说吧，你为什么没有死？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"与你无关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，那我换个问法，你为什么要回来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱昂图索没有告诉你吗？我欠贝洛内一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，我是不是可以理解为，你知道贝洛内是为了让你对付我们罗塞蒂才让你回来的，你还是回来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是回来之后才知道的，不过——你确实可以这么理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的坦诚甚至让我怀疑是不是我出了问题，最后的德克萨斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道你要告诉我，你已经完全忘记了，德克萨斯这个姓氏曾经统领着哥伦比亚大大小小的家族？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的爷爷，萨尔瓦多雷曾经是每一个哥伦比亚家族成员的信仰？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克萨斯留下的一切，都与我无关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都与你无关？！"},{"type":"narration","text":"瓦拉赫一拳打在旁边的茶几上，鲜血从手指上流了下来。\n而他仿佛浑然未觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是切利尼娜·德克萨斯！萨尔瓦多雷的孙女！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你只要活着，那些东西就与你有关！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"光是你的名字出现在罗塞蒂的会议桌上，就会让我们不得不去改变行动的方针！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们曾经以德克萨斯为荣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了不让萨尔瓦多雷的心血白费，你知不知道，乔万娜花了多少力气才将剩下的哥伦比亚家族重新统合起来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知不知道，我们如何向西西里夫人卑躬屈膝，最终选择向叙拉古回流，从哥伦比亚千里迢迢返回叙拉古？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了生存，我们甚至将建造移动城市的技术和盘托出，几乎在免费为叙拉古建造新的移动城市——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一切都是因为德克萨斯的陨落，我们不得不接受了这个事实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而现在，你，最后的德克萨斯，堂而皇之地踏上了这片土地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"却说你与这一切无关，你只是来还债。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你甚至站在了我们的对立面！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你欠贝洛内的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你活着，那你欠哥伦比亚家族的更多！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我或许欠乔万娜一个交代，但我不欠哥伦比亚家族的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完成和贝洛内的约定后，我会离开叙拉古。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得我会相信吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的存在，就是对罗塞蒂根基的动摇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乔万娜呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我问，为什么是你来见我，而不是乔万娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是她的代言人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不会说，向西西里夫人卑躬屈膝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她也不会派一个使者来见我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为你了解她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从你的表现来看，或许是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......真可惜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，我还是不够了解传闻中的德克萨斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为我的演技不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不算差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，你高谈阔论着叙拉古，仿佛已经看穿了这个国家的样子，让我觉得......很熟悉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不推荐你这么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为这意味着......你还不够了解这个国家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，有一点你说得对，我既然回来了，应该和乔万娜聊一聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你见不到她的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，最后的德克萨斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你太像一个叙拉古人了，不，你是一个彻头彻尾的叙拉古人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我不能让你见首领。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你会动摇她，你会动摇许多人，你会毁了许多东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，请回吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去履行你和贝洛内的约定吧，然后，滚回你苟且偷生的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想做什么都是你的自由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，唯独有一点，请你记住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗塞蒂家族，不欢迎你。"},{"type":"narration","text":"德克萨斯站起身，向门口走去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"杀手们不自觉地为她让出一条道路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她环视一圈，从这些哥伦比亚人的眼中读出了愤怒，不解，厌恶，困惑等等情绪。\n这就是这个姓氏带来的东西。\n德克萨斯。\n她叹了口气，走出房间。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稀客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要见贝纳尔多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我提醒过你很多次，不要直呼首领的名字，拉维妮娅小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道他在哪，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有什么理由必须告诉你吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我现在站在这里，听完你作为胜利者的嘲讽，可以让你告诉我的话，我不在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胜利者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉你也无妨，首领已经启程去萨卢佐家族的宅邸了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你见不到他的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想在这座宅子怎么闹，都是你的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，首领既然决定去和萨卢佐家谈，那么，我劝你不要做多余的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用你提醒我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，拉维妮娅小姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么看待我，我并不在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我希望你不要忘记。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱昂是这个家族的一员，是他偏离了家族应有的轨道在先。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是一个家族，一个家族应当齐心协力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"轨道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何必把野心说得这么好听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g1_srcstreet"},{"type":"narration","text":"一滴雨滴打在眼眶，顺流而下，像是一道泪痕。\n拉维妮娅从来没有感觉到叙拉古的雨是如此冰冷。\n但她马上擦去了雨痕。\n还不到时候。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":true,"text":"哪位？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我找企鹅物流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我就是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在有空吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":true,"text":"正好有一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们公司都有什么业务？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":true,"text":"送信，送话，送货，还有......送人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克萨斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":true,"text":"风雨无阻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉维妮娅","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好，我有一份委托。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g8_srcroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，空，你果然在卡特琳娜小姐家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"这里有好多资料，而且不少剧本中都能看到卡特琳娜小姐的笔记。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"她真的很喜欢自己的职业呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别叹气啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们都知道，你也不想把演员事业只是当做寻找德克萨斯的手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，但是，眼下的情况，还是要以见到德克萨斯为优先呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟，连那个拉普兰德也回到了叙拉古，而且还做了那么出格的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实想一想也是理所当然的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总觉得她会出现在一切德克萨斯会出现的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"你们觉得，她是想要帮德克萨斯才那么做的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然结果上来说，德克萨斯的嫌疑确实被洗清了，但是怎么想都很奇怪吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我也觉得，她应该是有自己的目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我是真的不擅长应付这个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说是德克萨斯的朋友肯定谈不上，但是，如果是仇家，哪有态度这么暧昧的仇家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"搞不清楚她到底想在德克萨斯身上找到什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但她之前送我的千层酥还蛮好吃的欸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吃货闭嘴啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以前也猜不透莫斯提马在想什么，但是等我逐渐不去想这件事后，我反而有点理解了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得拉普兰德也是一样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像她们这样的人，与其去猜她们到底在想什么，不如干脆地接受她们的每一句话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有相信她们的每一句话都是真的，才能看穿她们最后是不是在用真实编织一个谎言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可颂","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我先去买点吃的，能天使，护卫就拜托你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空，又在练台词呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，卡特琳娜小姐，你好呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"因为《德克萨斯之死》的第二幕快要正式演出了，所以我最近打算努力一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，已经到了这个日子了吗，我都忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能天使，吃披萨吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，卡特琳娜小姐既然是剧本作者，到时候一定会来看吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我其实就是想来告诉你，我会暂时离开一段时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"你要离开很久吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......如果顺利的话，应该不会很久吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，不是什么大事，家里出了点状况，我这个做大姐的，要回去主持一下大局而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当姐姐的还真是辛苦欸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，还好啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只可惜，第三幕的高潮我还是没有想好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，但愿这次回老家能找到一些灵感吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，别露出这副表情嘛，只是平时见不到了而已，第二幕的上演我应该会抽空去看的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说不定到时候去后台找你玩哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟是好不容易交到的朋友，而且又是我自己写的剧本，我也想在近距离观赏呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，那就这么说定了，你过来的话一定要联络我哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡特琳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我先走了，拜拜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"拜拜~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再见~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g6_newtown_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首领，不用带行李吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等事情处理完，我还要回这里写剧本呢，有什么好带的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卢佐和贝洛内现在是什么反应？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卢佐邀请莱昂图索少爷去赴宴，贝纳尔多这头老狼应了下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这场宴会可有意思了，现在所有人都在看着他们呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们要做些什么反应吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦拉赫，帮我安排一场行程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要去看《德克萨斯之死》第二幕的上演。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瓦拉赫","speakerId":"avg_npc_695_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就这么关心自己写的剧本吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，这可是我的心血之作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，你不是问我们要做什么反应吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是我的反应，既然贝纳尔多·贝洛内都从他的剧院里走出来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔万娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_687_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我，乔万娜·罗塞蒂，也该回来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_101_sora","aliases":["空"]}]}
